ls: handled by Stripe. We receive the payment status and the last digits and brand of the card, never the full card number."}],["$","p","3",{"children":"Messages: what you send us by email, WhatsApp or the contact form."}],["$","p","4",{"children":"Usage data: pages viewed and clicks, only if you allow statistics cookies."}]]]}],["$","div","pol_pr3_t",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"policy-s3","style":{"fontSize":21,"marginBottom":10},"children":[3,". ","Why we use it"]}],[["$","p","0",{"children":"To create and run your account; to take, confirm and manage bookings with providers; to deliver digital products; to answer your questions; to prevent fraud and misuse (for example the device limits on map access); to keep the records the law requires; and, only with your consent, to measure and improve the site and our advertising."}]]]}],["$","div","pol_pr4_t",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"policy-s4","style":{"fontSize":21,"marginBottom":10},"children":[4,". ","Our basis"]}],[["$","p","0",{"children":"We use your data to perform the contract with you (your account and bookings), to meet legal obligations (accounting and tax records), for our legitimate interest in keeping the service secure, and on your consent for statistics and marketing cookies. You can withdraw consent at any time."}]]]}],"$L3","$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8"]}],"$L9"]}]]}]]}]}],null,"$La"]}],"isPartial":"$@b","staleTime":"$c","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Ld","isPartial":"$@e","staleTime":"$c","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Lf","isPartial":"$@10","staleTime":"$c","varyParams":"$11"}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@12","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@13"}
